  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "CLIENT PROPOSAL / CB-026 · v 01 · 1 October 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Staff workshop design"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "For Alder Learning Cooperative"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "From Northline Learning Studio"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE — FOR DISCUSSION"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "01 Decision and terms"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Discuss the proposed workshop package and resolve the start conditions before confirming the scope."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Prepare a reusable 90-minute workshop for 12 staff who support adult learners."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Design materials only; live facilitation and evidence of learning impact are outside scope."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Commercial terms"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Illustrative proposed fee : 1,200"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Currency: USD"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Basis: One fixed design package covering S01 to S04 only."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Tax: Unresolved — confirm before agreement."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Payment: Proposed: one invoice after the final package; payment due 30 days after invoice. Subject to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Expenses: No travel is proposed. Any additional expense requires a separate scope decision."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Resolve before work starts"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "All three decisions below block the start."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U01 Start date — Client coordinator . Confirm staff availability and the source-material handoff date."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U02 Commercial terms — Client purchasing contact . Confirm tax treatment and proposed payment terms."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U03 Use of materials — Client coordinator and provider . Agree who may edit, share and reuse the final…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "02 Scope"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Included: Proposed within this scope; not evidence of approval or completed work."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Excluded: No output or charge is assumed for this work."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Unresolved: A decision is required before the affected work can begin."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Six scope records · proposed boundaries"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Change route"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Record the requested change, affected scope IDs, schedule effect and commercial effect. Obtain an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "03 Delivery and next decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Start anchor: After U01–U03 are resolved, the scope is expressly confirmed and client source materials…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "M01 Confirm design brief"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Output: Audience and objective summary from S01."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Depends on: Client supplies existing materials and one coordinator."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Window: Within two working days of the start anchor."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Review owner: Client coordinator"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Check: Written comments confirm or correct the design assumptions."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "M02 Review draft package"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Output: Draft guide and participant pack from S02–S03."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Depends on: M01 assumptions resolved; one client feedback owner available."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Window: Within five working days after the brief is confirmed."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Review owner: Client coordinator"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Check: One consolidated list of requested changes is returned."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "M03 Deliver revised files"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Output: Final editable package and change log from S04."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Depends on: Client feedback fits the agreed scope; additions follow the change route."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Window: Within three working days after consolidated feedback is received."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Review owner: Client coordinator"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Check: Files open and required sections are present; no learning outcome is asserted."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Responsibilities"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Provider: Prepare the specified files and document changes."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Client: Supply source materials, resolve open terms and consolidate feedback."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Next decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Client coordinator returns responses to U01–U03 and any requested scope changes. No work start or…"
    }
  ],
